cmb/1
HUMAN "Jupiter Hudson"
AGENT research_bot
ALLOW web.search
ALLOW document.read
DENY person.profile
DENY memory.persist
SCOPE project cmb
PURPOSE "public research"
EXPIRES 2030-01-01T00:00:00Z
REQUIRE citations
REQUIRE provenance
ON uncertainty => ASK_HUMAN
ON scope_violation => HALT
ON expiry => REVOKE
DELEGABLE false
RETURN receipt
